  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Compensating control for the ST-SEC-009 exception: the analyzer exclusion works per activity TYPE (all HTTP Request activities), so this offline test makes sure the SecureString-to-String conversion stays limited to the two accepted places: Workflows\Supabase\GetRows.xaml and Workflows\Supabase\UpdateRows.xaml.&#xA;Scans every .xaml in the project (dot folders and this file excluded) for the usual conversion patterns." DisplayName="SecureStringConversionGuardTestCase" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
